{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午8時50分，天文台錄得28.5°C，相對濕度74%。</p><p>一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p>本港地區今日（18日，重陽節）天氣預測部分時間有陽光。</p><p>早上局部地區有一兩陣微雨，日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約31°C，新界再高一兩度。</p><p>吹和緩至清勁東風，初時高地間中吹強風。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T01:38:39.810555+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:55:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T13:57:46.875631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:37:34.934149+00:00","content_hash":"5f7904595b45287831aa7f0eba7189040a3cb3e8a7210d2983d5e2fa4fba4091","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}